  "summary": "Air conditioning (RPO C60): the plenum valve (outside-air / recirculation door) at the plenum filler panel, on the right side of the dash under the cowl, and its vacuum actuator. The valve and a mounting bracket are screwed to the plenum filler panel (into a tapping plate, sheet A8); the vacuum actuator's own studs pass through the panel and bracket and take nuts, and its rod is pinned to the valve with a cotter pin. The vacuum hose clips onto the actuator (Views B and C).",
